{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;You can't get away! The Powerful Monkey Council members will be my ultimate power source!&quot; - Sticky Funnybone</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strato Freaks DX is a not-so-classic style shoot-'em-up, loosely based on classic games like Fantasy Zone, packed full of modern score attack elements. Fly around each looping level, collect the magic monkeys, rack up your combo, and beat the boss in a frantic winner-takes-all slugfest in the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957840/extras/5b529504f5054f6a993c4f9cecd3946f.poster.avif?t=1769856328\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957840/extras/5b529504f5054f6a993c4f9cecd3946f.webm?t=1769856328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957840/extras/5b529504f5054f6a993c4f9cecd3946f.mp4?t=1769856328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different planets, each crazier than the last!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes such as Turbo, Sticky Survival, and Hi-Speed Havoc,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide cast of playable characters spanning the entire Super Freaks series,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide array of powerups to raze those robots!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can YOU save the Council and kick Sticky's skeletal behind before he takes over the world?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957840?t=1769856328","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957840?t=1